│     - **Trailing ZWJ in `_cell_len`:** `next(iter_characters)` raised `StopIteration` when a ZWJ │
│ was the last character; it now uses `next(iter_characters, None)`.                               │
│     - **ZWJ and VS16 in `split_graphemes`:** a ZWJ at the end could push the span end past the   │
│ text length, so the index is now clamped to `codepoint_count`. A leading variation selector      │
│ (VS16 with no preceding character) never advanced the index, which would loop forever; it now    │
│ always advances by one.                                                                          │
│                                                                                                  │
